nce metrics\\n   - Comparative analysis\\n   - Visualization of results\\n   - Insights for model improvement\\n\\n## Test Directories\\n- Test Framework Location: /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/tdd_model_validation/tests\\n- Output Directory: /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/tdd_model_validation\\n\\n## Next Steps\\n- Design specific test cases\\n- Implement performance measurement tools\\n- Set up automated testing infrastructure"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01ENCtpceN7RK31u9tSRBfK6', 'name': 'git_commit', 'input': {'message': 'Complete TDD Coordinator Model Update - Milestone 1: Performance benchmarking framework planned', 'files': ['src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md', 'src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m1.md', 'src/field/ensemble_ui/tdd_model_validation/performance_benchmark_plan.md']}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01ENCtpceN7RK31u9tSRBfK6', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "No changes to commit", "commit_hash": null}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01JYexLx5BUKCZooeZ3FzVJ9', 'name': 'run_command', 'input': {'command': 'git add .', 'working_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01JYexLx5BUKCZooeZ3FzVJ9', 'content': '{"success": true, "exit_code": 0, "stdout": "", "stderr": ""}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01MjgSMgtDjtxBiZCSaCT6pV', 'name': 'git_commit', 'input': {'message': 'Complete TDD Coordinator Model Update - Milestone 1: Performance benchmarking framework planned'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01MjgSMgtDjtxBi