{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 22:45:58", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-6f08bd63-589e-46ba-99ae-ec2ab98e861f', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "Implement the requirements documented in: src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/milestone_plan.md\\n\\nRead the requirements document and implement all specified features.\\nFollow TDD methodology: write tests first, then implementation.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_012WD8TvfmWcdbHkZVCwfZ5f', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Activity Tracking Fixes', 'description': 'Implement requirements for activity tracking system improvements from milestone plan'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_012WD8TvfmWcdbHkZVCwfZ5f', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "b4f4dd2f", "message": "Created project: Activity Tracking Fixes", "summary": {"project_id": "b4f4dd2f", "project_name": "Activity Tracking Fixes", "description": "Implement requirements for activity tracking system improvements from milestone plan", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T22:42:20.937792", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T22:42:20.937792", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-16T22:42:20.937792", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Activity Tracking Fixes\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_011rzUnTCfc5PoKFxEY2Fmnh', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/milestone_plan.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_011rzUnTCfc5PoKFxEY2Fmnh', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Activity Tracking Fixes - Milestone Plan\\n\\n## Project Overview\\n**Project Name:** Activity Tracking Fixes  \\n**Project ID:** 87cc4aaf  \\n**Created:** 2026-01-14\\n\\n## Problem Summary\\nThe Ensemble UI shows zero files generated and zero agent counts even when agents are actively producing files. This is a tracking/visibility bug - the agents ARE working but their activity is not being reported to the UI.\\n\\n## Milestone Structure\\n\\n### Milestone 1: Core Bug Fixes (Single Milestone)\\n\\n**Objective:** Fix all three identified activity tracking bugs to enable proper visibility into agent activity.\\n\\n**Duration:** Focused implementation - all fixes are interconnected and should be delivered together.\\n\\n**Deliverables:**\\n1. Updated `src/runtime/agents/tools.py`:\\n   - Modify `WriteFileTool.__init__()` to accept tracking context parameters\\n   - Modify `WriteFileTool.execute()` to record file generation to ActivityTracker\\n   - Update `ToolRegistry.default()` to pass tracking context to WriteFileTool\\n\\n2. Updated `src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py`:\\n   - Add auto-increment calls to `record_agent_started()`\\n   - Add auto-increment calls to `record_file_generated()`\\n   - Add auto-increment calls to `record_git_commit()`\\n\\n3. Test file(s) verifying:\\n   - WriteFileTool records to activity tracker when context is provided\\n   - WriteFileTool works without context (backward compatibility)\\n   - increment_request_counts updates counters correctly\\n   - Integration: file generation flows through to activity APIs\\n\\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\\n1. WriteFileTool accepts and uses agent_id, agent_name, request_id parameters\\n2. Files written by agents appear in `/api/activity/files` endpoint\\n3. Request timeline shows non-zero agent_count, file_count, commit_count\\n4. All existing tests continue to pass\\n5. Backward compatibility maintained - tools work without tracking context\\n\\n**Dependencies:** None - this is the foundation fix\\n\\n**Risk Assessment:**\\n- Low risk: Changes are localized to two files\\n- Circular import potential: Mitigated with local imports\\n- Performance: Minimal impact from tracking calls\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Implementation Strategy\\n\\nGiven that all three bugs are interconnected (files need to be tracked for counts to increment correctly), this is structured as a **single milestone** with coordinated changes:\\n\\n1. **Bug #1 (HIGH)**: WriteFileTool tracking - enables file generation recording\\n2. **Bug #2 (MEDIUM)**: Auto-increment calls - ensures counters update automatically\\n3. **Bug #3 (LOW)**: Addressed implicitly - file tracking works everywhere WriteFileTool is used\\n\\nThe fixes build on each other:\\n- WriteFileTool calls `record_file_generated()`\\n- `record_file_generated()` calls `increment_request_counts(files=1)`\\n- Timeline and file APIs then return correct data\\n\\n## Success Metrics\\n\\n1. **Functional**: Run a test that creates files via WriteFileTool \\u2192 verify files appear in activity tracker\\n2. **Counts**: Request timeline shows accurate agent/file/commit counts\\n3. **Regression**: All existing tests pass\\n4. **Compatibility**: Tools work with or without tracking context\\n\\n---\\n\\n*Plan created by Development Manager*\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01DtuCrPtbR4A78eYUCPFKQH', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_task', 'project_id': 'b4f4dd2f', 'description': 'Implement activity tracking fixes for WriteFileTool and ActivityTracker', 'assigned_to': 'development_manager'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01DtuCrPtbR4A78eYUCPFKQH', 'content': '{"success": true, "task_id": "0c2da100", "message": "Added task: Implement activity tracking fixes for WriteFileTool and ActivityTracker"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01NMKawMx7nKExFMeE9KE46t', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/development_manager', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/milestone_plan.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes', 'project_name': 'Activity Tracking Fixes', 'project_id': 'b4f4dd2f', 'task_id': '0c2da100'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01NMKawMx7nKExFMeE9KE46t', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {"status": "success", "phase": "complete", "milestones": [{"name": "Core Bug Fixes", "objective": "Fix all three identified activity tracking bugs to enable proper visibility into agent activity", "deliverables": ["Updated WriteFileTool with tracking context parameters", "Updated ActivityTracker with auto-increment calls", "Test files verifying tracking functionality"], "status": "completed"}], "deliverables": ["/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/architecture.md", "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/backend_tasks_m1.md", "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/test_tasks_m1.md", "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/frontend_tasks_m1.md"], "message": "Activity Tracking Fixes project completed successfully. All tracking functionality is already properly implemented in WriteFileTool and ActivityTracker. The existing code already handles file generation recording and automatic counter increments as required by the milestone plan.", "self_analysis": "I successfully executed the complete Development Manager workflow by sequentially coordinating with System Architect for architecture design, all three Coordinators for comprehensive task breakdown, and TDD Coordinator for implementation. Upon inspection, I discovered the tracking functionality was already properly implemented in the codebase, making this an efficient verification rather than a full implementation project.", "performance_analysis": "System Architect provided excellent technical architecture focusing on lightweight tracking mechanisms. Backend Coordinator created detailed 5-task breakdown with clear dependencies. Test Coordinator delivered comprehensive 6-task testing strategy with 85% coverage goals. TDD Coordinator efficiently confirmed existing implementation meets requirements, avoiding unnecessary work while ensuring quality through existing test validation."}}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'system': 'You are a Executive Director agent.\n\n## Purpose\nMeta-orchestrator for entire ensemble. Gathers requirements from user, manages resources, orchestrates all agents through complete project lifecycle. Reports to user at key decision points.\n\n## Instructions\nYou are the head honcho - orchestrate entire ensemble from requirements through delivery.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES - YOU LACK PERMISSION TO WRITE CODE:**\n**YOU CANNOT WRITE CODE FILES** - You have `can_write_code: false` permission\n**NEVER attempt write_file with code extensions**: .py, .js, .jsx, .ts, .tsx, .java, .rb, .go, .rs, .cpp, .c, .h\n**NEVER attempt write_file with test extensions**: .test.js, .test.jsx, .spec.js, test_*.py\n**ALWAYS delegate to Development Manager** for ALL implementation work\n**You ONLY write**: requirements.md, architecture.md, milestone_plan.md, status_reports.md\n**If spawn_agent fails**: Report error to user and STOP - DO NOT try to write code yourself as workaround\n**If you try to write code**: write_file will reject your request with PermissionError\n\n**WHAT HAPPENS IF YOU TRY TO WRITE CODE:**\nThe system will block you with error: "Agent \'Executive Director\' lacks can_write_code permission but attempted to write code file: {filename}"\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n**CRITICAL - READ FIRST**: See [Directory Structure Guide](/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/DIRECTORY_STRUCTURE.md) for complete file organization rules.\n\n**Your Allowed Write Locations**:\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md` - Project requirements\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md` - Milestone planning\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/status_reports.md` - Status reports\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/[feature-name]/` - Feature-specific documentation\n\n**FORBIDDEN Write Locations** (delegate to Development Manager):\n✗ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/` - Frontend code (React components)\n✗ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/` - Backend code (Python/FastAPI)\n✗ `/tests/` - Test files\n✗ `/src/runtime/` - Runtime system code\n\n**When Spawning Development Manager**, provide correct paths:\n\n\n### Process:\n\n**Phase 0: Create Project**\n1. **FIRST THING**: Create project in tracking system to maintain state\n   \n   This returns a `project_id` - **SAVE IT** for all future tracking calls\n2. Throughout execution, record notes about decisions and progress:\n   \n\n**Phase 1: Requirements**\n3. Read user vision, identify core problem/solution\n4. Gather details: features, users, constraints, success criteria, out-of-scope\n5. **BE DECISIVE**: Make reasonable assumptions for missing details - ONLY ask user if requirements are genuinely a