ons\\n\\n## Recommended Test Approach\\n1. Manual verification of first prototype\\n2. Develop comprehensive test script\\n3. Automate tests in CI/CD pipeline\\n4. Continuous integration testing\\n\\n## Test Execution Priority\\n1. Session Management Tests (Critical)\\n2. Layout Configuration Tests (High)\\n3. Individual Pane Tests (High)\\n4. Compatibility Tests (Medium)\\n5. Error Handling Tests (Medium)\\n6. Performance Tests (Low)\\n\\n## Risks and Mitigations\\n- Risk: Complex tmux configuration\\n  Mitigation: Modular script design, extensive testing\\n- Risk: Cross-platform compatibility issues\\n  Mitigation: Comprehensive OS and shell testing\\n\\n## Test Deliverables\\n- Bash test script for automated testing\\n- Test result documentation template\\n- Compatibility matrix\\n\\n## Open Issues\\n- Confirm precise tmux version compatibility\\n- Clarify default configurations"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_018yrmXS5uPesD58M67c4xVq', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/tdd_coordinator', 'input_data': {'problem_description': 'Implement Milestone 1: Basic Tmux Layout (MVP) for tmux monitoring dashboard. Create functional 2x2 tmux layout with session management scripts (start_monitor.sh, stop_monitor.sh), 2x2 layout with shell, log tail, vim browser, and basic task watching. Focus on foundational tmux orchestration, live log streaming, file browser integration, and simple task display.', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/tmux_monitoring_dashboard', 'test_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/tmux_monitoring_dashboard/tests', 'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/tmux_monitoring_dashboard/requirements.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_018yrmXS5uPesD58M67c