{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 22:46:33", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-1d47c15a-0b8c-40e1-b464-0b768a5ee639', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "problem_description": "Fix Activity Tracking Fixes Milestone 1: Modify WriteFileTool to record file generation to ActivityTracker and auto-increment request counts. This is a surgical fix to enable proper activity tracking in Ensemble UI - files generated by agents should appear in /api/activity/files and timeline counts should be non-zero.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src",\n  "test_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/tests",\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/requirements.md"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_014RxmUo6c4YteVQu9p2Mxwe', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/activity_tracking_fixes/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_014RxmUo6c4YteVQu9p2Mxwe', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Activity Tracking Fixes - Requirements Document\\n\\n## Executive Summary\\n\\nThis project addresses three critical bugs in the Ensemble UI agent system that prevent proper activity tracking. Files generated by agents, request counts, and activity metrics are not being correctly recorded or surfaced via the activity APIs.\\n\\n## Problem Statement\\n\\nThe Ensemble UI shows zero files generated and zero agent counts even when agents are actively producing files and completing tasks. This is a **tracking/visibility bug**, not a functionality bug - the agents ARE working correctly, but their activity is not being reported to the UI.\\n\\n### Root Causes Identified\\n\\n1. **Bug #1: WriteFileTool Does Not Record to Activity Tracker** (HIGH PRIORITY)\\n   - Location: `src/runtime/agents/tools.py` - `WriteFileTool.execute()`\\n   - Impact: Files written by spawned agents are never tracked\\n\\n2. **Bug #2: Request Counts Never Incremented** (MEDIUM PRIORITY)\\n   - Location: `src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py`\\n   - Method `increment_request_counts()` is defined but never called\\n   - Impact: Timeline view shows 0 agents, 0 files, 0 commits for all requests\\n\\n3. **Bug #3: File Tracking Only Scans Output Directory** (LOW PRIORITY)\\n   - Location: `src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py`\\n   - Only files in output directory are scanned; files elsewhere are missed\\n   - Impact: Test files, source files written outside output directory not tracked\\n\\n## Objectives\\n\\n1. **Primary**: Ensure all file writes by agents are tracked via `record_file_generated()`\\n2. **Secondary**: Auto-increment request counters when agents start, files generate, commits occur\\n3. **Tertiary**: Validate fixes by confirming `/api/activity/files` returns correct data\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n### In Scope\\n- Modify `WriteFileTool` to accept and use tracking context (agent_id, request_id, agent_name)\\n- Modify `ToolRegistry.default()` to pass tracking context to WriteFileTool\\n- Add auto-increment calls to `record_agent_started()`, `record_file_generated()`, `record_git_commit()`\\n- Add tests to verify activity tracking works end-to-end\\n- Update existing tests if needed to accommodate new parameters\\n\\n### Out of Scope\\n- Modifying the activity API endpoints (they already work correctly)\\n- Changing the frontend display logic (it already consumes the API correctly)\\n- Major refactoring of the tool system architecture\\n\\n## Technical Requirements\\n\\n### Fix 1: WriteFileTool Tracking\\n\\n**Current Implementation:**\\n```python\\nclass WriteFileTool:\\n    def __init__(self, agent_definition: Optional[\\"AgentDefinition\\"] = None):\\n        self.agent_definition = agent_definition\\n```\\n\\n**Required Changes:**\\n```python\\nclass WriteFileTool:\\n    def __init__(\\n        self, \\n        agent_definition: Optional[\\"AgentDefinition\\"] = None,\\n        agent_id: Optional[str] = None,\\n        agent_name: Optional[str] = None,\\n        request_id: Optional[str] = None\\n    ):\\n        self.agent_definition = agent_definition\\n        self.agent_id = agent_id\\n        self.agent_name = agent_name or (agent_definition.name if agent_definition else \\"unknown\\")\\n        self.request_id = request_id\\n```\\n\\n**In execute() method, after successful write:**\\n```python\\nif self.agent_id and self.request_id:\\n    try:\\n        from .runtime import AgentRuntime\\n        activity_tracker = AgentRuntime.get_activity_tracker()\\n        \\n        file_ext = file_path.suffix.lower()\\n        file_type_map = {\\n            \\".md\\": \\"markdown\\", \\".py\\": \\"python\\", \\".js\\": \\"javascript\\",\\n            \\".tsx\\": \\"typescript-react\\", \\".ts\\": \\"typescript\\",\\n            \\".json\\": \\"json\\", \\".yaml\\": \\"yaml\\", \\".yml\\": \\"yaml\\", \\".txt\\": \\"text\\"\\n        }\\n        file_type = file_type_map.get(file_ext, \\"unknown\\")\\n        \\n        preview = content[:500] if len(content) > 500 else content\\n        \\n        activity_tracker.record_file_generated(\\n            agent_id=self.agent_id,\\n            agent_name=self.agent_name,\\n            request_id=self.request_id,\\n            file_path=str(file_path),\\n            file_size=len(content),\\n            file_type=file_type,\\n            preview=preview\\n        )\\n    except Exception as e:\\n        logger.warning(f\\"Failed to record file generation: {e}\\")\\n```\\n\\n### Fix 2: ToolRegistry.default() Update\\n\\n**Current Implementation:**\\n```python\\nregistry.register(WriteFileTool(agent_definition))\\n```\\n\\n**Required Change:**\\n```python\\nregistry.register(WriteFileTool(\\n    agent_definition=agent_definition,\\n    agent_id=agent_id,\\n    agent_name=agent_definition.name if agent_definition else None,\\n    request_id=request_id\\n))\\n```\\n\\n### Fix 3: Auto-Increment Request Counts\\n\\n**In `record_agent_started()`:**\\n```python\\ndef record_agent_started(self, ...):\\n    # ... existing code ...\\n    self.increment_request_counts(request_id, agents=1)\\n```\\n\\n**In `record_file_generated()`:**\\n```python\\ndef record_file_generated(self, ...):\\n    # ... existing code ...\\n    self.increment_request_counts(request_id, files=1)\\n```\\n\\n**In `record_git_commit()`:**\\n```python\\ndef record_git_commit(self, ...):\\n    # ... existing code ...\\n    self.increment_request_counts(request_id, commits=1)\\n```\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n\\n1. **File Tracking Verification:**\\n   - Run an agent workflow that creates files\\n   - Query `/api/activity/files` \\n   - Verify response includes newly created files with correct metadata\\n\\n2. **Request Counts Verification:**\\n   - Query `/api/activity/timeline`\\n   - Verify `agent_count`, `file_count`, `commit_count` are non-zero for active requests\\n\\n3. **Regression Testing:**\\n   - All existing tests pass\\n   - New tests for activity tracking pass\\n\\n## Test Plan\\n\\n1. **Unit Tests:**\\n   - Test WriteFileTool records to activity tracker when context is provided\\n   - Test WriteFileTool gracefully handles missing context (backward compatibility)\\n   - Test increment_request_counts updates counters correctly\\n\\n2. **Integration Tests:**\\n   - Test full agent execution records file generation\\n   - Test timeline API returns correct counts\\n   - Test files API returns files with correct agent attribution\\n\\n## Assumptions Made\\n\\n1. The ActivityTracker singleton pattern will work for capturing all file writes\\n2. Import cycle concerns can be handled with local imports\\n3. Existing API endpoints don\'t need modification - they already query the tracker correctly\\n4. Minor performance impact of tracking is acceptable\\n\\n## Constraints\\n\\n1. Must maintain backward compatibility - tools should work even without tracking context\\n2. Must not break existing tests\\n3. Changes should be localized to the identified files\\n\\n## Deliverables\\n\\n1. Updated `src/runtime/agents/tools.py` with WriteFileTool tracking\\n2. Updated `src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py` with auto-increment calls\\n3. Test file(s) verifying the fix\\n4. Updated documentation (this file + any inline comments)\\n\\n---\\n\\n*Requirements documented: 2026-01-14*\\n*Project ID: 87cc4aaf*\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01B53SyVKk1gWPYE4YXfwBES', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'code_writer', 'input_data': {'files_to_modify': ['/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/runtime/agents/tools.py', '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py'], 'requirements': 'Implement activity tracking fixes as per requirements document, focusing on WriteFileTool modifications and request count tracking.'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01B53SyVKk1gWPYE4YXfwBES', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Unknown agent type: code_writer. Agent definition file not found."}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'system': 'You are a  agent.\n\n## Purpose\n\n\n## Instructions\n\n\n## Input Format\nYour input will be provided in the following format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## Output Format\nYou must respond with JSON matching this exact format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## When to Request Clarificatio