{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 22:46:39", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-32066056-907e-4aa1-a215-b3e86a0cdda6', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/github-bots/requirements.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "GitHub Bots Implementation"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01GZAwE9tLUgrRUQTuUKjUEW', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/github-bots/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01GZAwE9tLUgrRUQTuUKjUEW', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# GitHub Sync Bot Requirements\\n\\n## Project Overview\\n- **Milestone**: 2 of 6 in GitHub Bots Suite\\n- **Purpose**: Implement advanced git synchronization capabilities\\n\\n## Core Capabilities\\n1. Remote Synchronization\\n   - Fetch and pull operations from remote repositories\\n   - Support for multiple remote repositories\\n   \\n2. Branch Management\\n   - Rebase operations with robust conflict handling\\n   - Safe stash management (save, restore, list)\\n   \\n3. Error Handling\\n   - Detailed conflict detection\\n   - Clear error reporting\\n   - Preservation of uncommitted changes\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n- \\u2713 Successfully rebase branch with upstream changes\\n- \\u2713 Safely stash uncommitted changes before sync\\n- \\u2713 Detect and report conflicts clearly\\n- \\u2713 Restore stashed changes after successful sync\\n- \\u2713 Complete operations within 30 seconds for typical repositories\\n\\n## Technical Constraints\\n- Use existing base classes and configuration system\\n- Implement using Test-Driven Development (TDD)\\n- Comprehensive error handling\\n- Logging of all synchronization events\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Full repository migration\\n- Complex merge conflict resolution\\n- Support for non-git version control systems\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- Base git configuration and authentication are already set up\\n- Typical repository size is under 1GB\\n- Standard git workflow (single branch, linear history)"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01RMw2xVxr3sCCvTPBAApYjk', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# GitHub Sync Bot - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\n**Project**: GitHub Sync Bot Implementation\n**Type**: Milestone 2 of 6 in GitHub Bots Suite\n**Scope**: Advanced git synchronization capabilities\n\n## Milestone Breakdown\n\n### Milestone 1: Core Infrastructure & Remote Operations\n**Duration**: 3-4 days\n**Objective**: Establish foundational sync capabilities\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Remote repository connection management\n- Basic fetch/pull operations\n- Configuration system integration\n- Core error handling framework\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- ✓ Can connect to multiple remote repositories\n- ✓ Fetch operations complete successfully\n- ✓ Pull operations work without conflicts\n- ✓ Basic error logging implemented\n\n**Dependencies**: Base classes and configuration system\n\n### Milestone 2: Branch Management & Stash Operations\n**Duration**: 4-5 days\n**Objective**: Implement safe branch operations with stash management\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Stash save/restore/list functionality\n- Branch rebase capabilities\n- Uncommitted changes preservation\n- Enhanced conflict detection\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- ✓ Safely stash uncommitted changes before sync\n- ✓ Restore stashed changes after successful sync\n- ✓ Rebase operations work with conflict detection\n- ✓ Clear error reporting for conflicts\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 completion\n\n### Milestone 3: Advanced Error Handling & Performance\n**Duration**: 2-3 days\n**Objective**: Robust error handling and performance optimization\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Comprehensive conflict resolution reporting\n- Performance optimization for large repos\n- Complete logging system\n- Final testing and documentation\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- ✓ Operations complete within 30 seconds for typical repos\n- ✓ Detailed conflict detection and reporting\n- ✓ All synchronization events logged\n- ✓ Complete test coverage\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 2 completion\n\n## Success Metrics\n- All acceptance criteria met\n- Test coverage > 90%\n- Performance benchmarks achieved\n- Integration with existing bot suite\n- Documentation complete\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n- Use TDD to catch issues early\n- Incremental development approach\n- Regular integration testing\n- Clear rollback procedures for each milestone'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01RMw2xVxr3sCCvTPBAApYjk', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_224251.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_224251.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01GmqKxBxEaYWqSPAL9sPjDb', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbill