{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 22:46:48", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-5e8934a5-22a0-4dcc-99c3-b2609eee6a1b', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "problem_description": "Implement Agent Families system with family name generation, inheritance, and tracking",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/runtime/agents",\n  "test_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/tests/runtime",\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/agent_families/requirements.md"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01RwqbNcc32dBNx4W6kejnK6', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/agent_families/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01RwqbNcc32dBNx4W6kejnK6', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Agent Families Implementation Requirements\\n\\n## Project Overview\\nImplement a family-based naming and achievement system for agent groups to provide visual cohesion and collective tracking across the ensemble.\\n\\n## Core Requirements\\n1. **Family Name Generation**\\n   - Unique family name generated when Executive Director spawns a new task group\\n   - Family name should be consistent and memorable\\n   - Supports tracking of collective achievements\\n\\n2. **Family Name Inheritance**\\n   - All child agents automatically inherit the parent\'s family name\\n   - Family name persists throughout the entire task lifecycle\\n   - Stored in agent metadata and runtime state\\n\\n3. **UI and Tracking Enhancements**\\n   - Update UI hierarchy view to display family groupings\\n   - Expose family information through API endpoints\\n   - Create visual indicators for family-based relationships\\n\\n4. **Family Achievements**\\n   - Implement at least 3 types of family-level achievements\\n   - Track collective metrics across family members\\n   - Provide aggregated performance insights\\n\\n## Technical Implementation Locations\\n- Runtime System:\\n  * `src/runtime/agents/name_generator.py`\\n  * `src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py`\\n  * `src/runtime/agents/runtime.py`\\n\\n- Frontend Components:\\n  * Require updates to agent display interfaces\\n  * API endpoint modifications for family data exposure\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n- \\u2713 New tasks spawn with unique, consistent family names\\n- \\u2713 Child agents automatically inherit family name\\n- \\u2713 Family names visible in all agent displays\\n- \\u2713 API supports family information retrieval\\n- \\u2713 Family-level achievement tracking implemented\\n\\n## Constraints\\n- Maintain existing agent spawning mechanisms\\n- Minimal performance overhead for name generation\\n- Backwards compatibility with existing systems\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Detailed family history tracking\\n- Complex genealogy systems\\n- Permanent family assignments across multiple projects\\n\\n## Potential Family Achievement Types\\n1. Collective Task Completion\\n2. Efficiency Metrics\\n3. Innovation Score\\n4. Collaborative Problem Solving\\n\\n## Notes\\n- Use whimsical, memorable naming strategies\\n- Ensure randomness prevents predictable family names\\n- Design for extensibility of family concept"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01TwY5hcXM754VP1siYqWzEa', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'code_writer', 'input_data': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/runtime/agents/name_generator.py', 'description': 'Implement family name generation logic with memorable and unique naming', 'requirements': ['Generate unique family names', 'Ensure consistency across task groups', 'Use whimsical and random generation strategy']}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01TwY5hcXM754VP1siYqWzEa', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Unknown agent type: code_writer. Agent definition file not found."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01PK3bz6nJW68XJX25d5tqHq', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/runtime/agents/name_generator.py', 'content': 'import random\nimport hashlib\nimport uuid\n\nclass FamilyNameGenerator:\n    """\n    Generates unique and memorable family names for agent groups.\n    """\n    \n    ADJECTIVE_POOL = [\n        "Brilliant", "Radiant", "Quantum", "Stellar", "Cosmic", \n        "Luminous", "Dynamic", "Enigmatic", "Vibrant", "Resilient"\n    ]\n    \n    NOUN_POOL = [\n        "Explorers", "Innovators", "Architects", "Navigators", \n        "Pioneers", "Dreamers", "Visionaries", "Strategists", \n        "Synergists", "Trailblazers"\n    ]\n    \n    @classmethod\n    def generate_family_name(cls, seed=None):\n        """\n        Generate a unique family name with optional seeding for consistency.\n        \n        Args:\n            seed (str, optional): A seed value to ensure consistent name generation.\n        \n        Returns:\n            str: A unique family name.\n        """\n        if seed is None:\n            seed = str(uuid.uuid4())\n        \n        # Use hashlib to generate a consistent random selection\n        hash_obj = hashlib.md5(seed.encode())\n        hash_hex = hash_obj.hexdigest()\n        \n        # Use hash to deterministically select adjective and noun\n        adj_index = int(hash_hex[:2], 16) % len(cls.ADJECTIVE_POOL)\n        noun_index = int(hash_hex[2:4], 16) % len(cls.NOUN_POOL)\n        \n        return f"{cls.ADJECTIVE_POOL[adj_index]} {cls.NOUN_POOL[noun_index]}"\n    \n    @classmethod\n    def validate_family_name(cls, name):\n        """\n        Validate that a family name follows the generation pattern.\n        \n        Args:\n            name (str): Family name to validate.\n        \n        Returns:\n            bool: Whether the name matches the generation pattern.\n        """\n        parts = name.split()\n        return (len(parts) == 2 and \n                parts[0] in cls.ADJECTIVE_POOL and \n                parts[1] in cls.NOUN_POOL)\n\n# Example usage\nif __name__ == "__main__":\n    # Demonstrate consistent name generation with seed\n    print(FamilyNameGenerator.generate_family_name("task_group_1"))\n    print(FamilyNameGenerator.generate_family_name("task_group_1"))  # Same name\n    print(FamilyNameGenerator.generate_family_name())  # Random name'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01PK3bz6nJW68XJX25d5tqHq', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "ROGUE AGENT DETECTED: Agent \'\' attempted to write code file \'/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/runtime/agents/name_generator.py\' but lacks can_write_code permission. This agent is a supervisor/coordinator and should delegate to code writers."}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01ASmw7HL7fm7GmagSdsuVEx', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Agent Families System', 'description': 'Implement Agent Families system with family name generation, inheritance, and tracking'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01ASmw7HL7fm7GmagSdsuVEx', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "77b82541", "message": "Created project: Agent Families System", "summary": {"project_id": "77b82541", "project_name": "Agent Families 