y_tracker.py` with family aggregation\n2. Achievement tracking for:\n   - Collective Task Completion\n   - Efficiency Badge\n   - Collaboration Star\n3. Comprehensive unit tests for achievement logic\n\n### Acceptance Criteria:\n- Activity tracking overhead < 5ms per operation\n- Accurate tracking of family-level achievements\n- Queryable achievement interface\n- 90%+ test coverage for tracking mechanisms\n\n## Milestone 3: API and Frontend Integration\n**Objective**: Expose family information through REST endpoints and update frontend to display family relationships and achievements.\n\n### Deliverables:\n1. New API endpoints for family information\n2. Updated React components for family display\n3. Responsive and accessible UI updates\n4. End-to-end integration tests\n\n### Acceptance Criteria:\n- Family names and achievements visible in UI\n- Responsive design maintained\n- API follows existing contract patterns\n- 90%+ test coverage for frontend and API components\n\n## Cross-Cutting Requirements\n- Maintain < 5ms performance overhead\n- 90%+ test coverage across all components\n- Full backwards compatibility\n- No breaking changes to existing API'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01CXGipMoi4iGFwA9pbExd5U', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_224313.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_224313.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01QpY9kUb1HCDdNRaXAv3hhF', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/outp