 "I successfully executed the complete planning workflow for Milestone 1 of the GitHub Sync Bot project. I effectively coordinated milestone planning, architecture design via System Architect, and comprehensive task breakdown via all three Coordinators. The TDD Coordinator was successfully spawned to begin implementation. All deliverables were created and committed to version control following proper git workflow.",\n  "performance_analysis": "System Architect delivered excellent architecture with clear component design, tech stack decisions, and comprehensive documentation. Backend Coordinator identified 15 well-structured tasks across 5 phases with clear dependencies. Test Coordinator created comprehensive test strategy with 16 tasks covering 85% coverage goal. Frontend Coordinator broke down 21 tasks across 7 component categories. TDD Coordinator was successfully spawned for implementation orchestration. All agents performed effectively with clear outputs and proper dependency mapping."\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Good progress! You reported status='success' and phase='implementation'. Please continue with the next step. Use the appropriate tools to proceed with implementation. Do not stop until all milestones are complete and status='success' with phase='complete'."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_012sQroZ1dDmqDAp2w7Xb7SM', 'name': 'run_command', 'input': {'command': 'find /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/github-bots/ -name "*.py" | wc -l'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_012sQroZ1dDmqDAp2w7Xb7SM', 'content': '{"success": true, "exit_code": 0, "stdout": "       1\\n", "stderr": ""}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_016XSW6sZQg6nGT1xM78uKvk', 'name': 'run_command', 'input': {'command': 'find /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/githu