{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 22:47:09", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-7b2d1ae5-a6c3-476f-a06e-d8c45b29317b', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/design-phase-pause-fix/requirements.md",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "project_name": "Design Phase Pause Fix Implementation",\n  "project_id": "ec9c483a"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01X3x7JZTGQicYjmEwuHomTM', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/design-phase-pause-fix/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01X3x7JZTGQicYjmEwuHomTM', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Requirements: Design Phase Pause Fix Implementation\\n\\n## Project Overview\\n**Project Name**: Design Phase Pause Fix Implementation\\n**Purpose**: Fix the agent pipeline termination issue when agents return `needs_user_input` status during the design phase\\n**Priority**: High - critical bug fix\\n**TDD Required**: Yes - write tests first, then implementation\\n\\n## Problem Statement\\nCurrently, when an Executive Director agent returns `status: \\"needs_user_input\\"` during the design phase, the backend incorrectly marks the agent as \\"completed\\" instead of pausing execution to wait for user input. This causes the pipeline to terminate prematurely, preventing proper user interaction and continuation.\\n\\n## Core Requirements\\n\\n### 1. Agent Status Handling (CRITICAL)\\n- **REQ-001**: `_execute_agent_background` method MUST detect `needs_user_input` status from agent results\\n- **REQ-002**: Agents with `needs_user_input` status MUST be marked as `\\"awaiting_user_input\\"` (NOT \\"completed\\")\\n- **REQ-003**: Agent context MUST be preserved for later continuation including:\\n  - Original input data\\n  - Question asked to user\\n  - Agent type information\\n- **REQ-004**: Agent logs MUST reflect waiting state with appropriate message\\n\\n### 2. Question-Answer Flow (CRITICAL)\\n- **REQ-005**: `answer_question` endpoint MUST trigger agent continuation after recording answer\\n- **REQ-006**: System MUST match answers to waiting agents using question_id\\n- **REQ-007**: Answer processing MUST happen asynchronously to avoid blocking response\\n\\n### 3. Agent Continuation (CRITICAL) \\n- **REQ-008**: New `continue_agent_with_answer` method MUST spawn fresh agent with continuation context\\n- **REQ-009**: Continuation context MUST include:\\n  - Original task input\\n  - Previous question\\n  - User\'s answer\\n  - Clear instruction to continue implementation\\n- **REQ-010**: Agent continuation MUST use Executive Director agent type for consistency\\n\\n### 4. Data Structure Requirements\\n- **REQ-011**: `active_agents[agent_id]` MUST support new fields:\\n  - `awaiting_question_id`: Links agent to pending question\\n  - `continuation_context`: Stores resumption data\\n- **REQ-012**: Status field MUST support `\\"awaiting_user_input\\"` state\\n- **REQ-013**: State transitions MUST follow: `running \\u2192 awaiting_user_input \\u2192 [answer] \\u2192 running \\u2192 completed`\\n\\n## Implementation Scope\\n\\n### Files to Modify\\n- **Primary**: `backend/main.py` - All core changes\\n- **Secondary**: Test files for validation\\n\\n### Components to Change\\n1. **`_execute_agent_background` method** (modify existing)\\n2. **`answer_question` endpoint** (modify existing) \\n3. **`continue_agent_with_answer` method** (add new)\\n\\n## Testing Requirements (TDD)\\n\\n### Unit Tests (MUST IMPLEMENT)\\n- **TEST-001**: Verify `_execute_agent_background` correctly detects `needs_user_input`\\n- **TEST-002**: Verify continuation context is properly stored and structured\\n- **TEST-003**: Verify `continue_agent_with_answer` builds correct input data\\n- **TEST-004**: Verify state transitions work correctly\\n- **TEST-005**: Verify question_id matching logic works\\n\\n### Integration Tests (MUST IMPLEMENT)\\n- **TEST-006**: Mock agent returns `needs_user_input` \\u2192 verify status becomes `awaiting_user_input`\\n- **TEST-007**: Submit answer \\u2192 verify new agent spawned with correct context\\n- **TEST-008**: End-to-end flow from question through continuation to completion\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- \\u2705 Agent pipeline NO LONGER terminates when `needs_user_input` is returned\\n- \\u2705 User sees appropriate \\"waiting\\" status in UI\\n- \\u2705 User can provide answer and agent continues with full context\\n- \\u2705 All tests pass (unit + integration)\\n- \\u2705 No regression in normal (non-question) agent execution flow\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Persistent storage for paused agents (agents lost on server restart)\\n- Multiple question support (one question per agent session)\\n- Question timeout handling\\n- Hot reload of agent definitions during continuation\\n- UI changes (backend focus only)\\n\\n## Technical Constraints\\n- **Language**: Python (FastAPI backend)\\n- **Testing Framework**: pytest\\n- **Async**: Must use async/await patterns for continuations\\n- **Backwards Compatibility**: Must not break existing agent execution\\n- **Error Handling**: Must gracefully handle missing agents or invalid question_ids\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- Question tracking system already exists and works correctly\\n- Executive Director agent can handle continuation context appropriately\\n- UI will properly display `awaiting_user_input` status\\n- Single concurrent answer per question_id (no race conditions expected)\\n\\n## Dependencies\\n- Existing `AgentOrchestrator` class\\n- Existing question tracking system\\n- FastAPI BackgroundTasks for async processing\\n- Current agent spawning infrastructure"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01CUmhLnT2BkpjRpKixjHKq3', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Design Phase Pause Fix Implementation', 'description': 'Fix the agent pipeline termination issue when agents return needs_user_input status during the design phase'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01CUmhLnT2BkpjRpKixjHKq3', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "5f4876a0", "message": "Created project: Design Phase Pause Fix Implementation", "summary": {"project_id": "5f4876a0", "project_name": "Design Phase Pause Fix Implementation", "description": "Fix the agent pipeline termination issue when agents return needs_user_input status during the design phase", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T22:46:48.888234", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T22:46:48.888234", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-16T22:46:48.888234", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Design Phase Pause Fix Implementation\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01TDfq8S3gzjxKtZD2pKMDCb', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# Milestone Plan: Design Phase Pause Fix Implementation\n\n## Project Overview\n**Project Name**: Design Phase Pause Fix Implementation  \n**Project ID**: 5f4876a0  \n**Priority**: High - Critical bug fix  \n**TDD Required**: Yes\n\n## Problem Summary\nThe agent pipeline incorrectly terminates when agents return `needs_user_input` status, marking them as "completed" instead of pausing for user input. This prevents proper user interaction during the design phase.\n\n## Milestone Breakdown\n\n### Milestone 1: Core Backend Implementation (Estimated: 2-3 hours)\n**Objective**: Implement the complete fix for the design phase pause issue\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Modified `_execute_agent_background` method to handle `needs_user_input` status\n- Modified `answer_question` endpoint to trigger agent continuation  \n- New `continue_agent_with_answer` method for agent resumption\n- Updated data structures to support `awaiting_user_input` status\n- Comprehensive test suite (unit + integration tests)\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- ✅ Agents with `needs_user_input` status are marked as `awaiting_user_input` (not completed)\n- ✅ Agent context is preserved including original input, question, and agent type\n- ✅ Answer processing triggers asynchronous agent continuation\n- ✅ Continuation spawns new agent with proper context\n- ✅ All unit tests pass (5 required tests minimum)\n- ✅ All integration tests pass (3 required tests minimum)\n- ✅ No regression in normal agent execution flow\n\n**Dependencies**: None (self-contained backend implementation)\n\n**Technical Components**:\n1. **Agent Status Detection**: Modify `_execute_agent_background` to detect `needs_user_input`\n2. **State Management**: Update agent status tracking and context preservation\n3. **Continuation Logic**: Implement `continue_agent_with_answer` method\n4. **Answer Processing**: Enhance `answer_question` endpoint for agent resumption\n5. **Test Coverage**: Comprehensive test suite for all new functionality\n\n**Files to Modify**:\n- `backend/main.py` (primary implementation)\n- Test files for validation\n\n**Success Metrics**:\n- Agent pipeline no longer terminates on `needs_user_input`\n- User can provide