ject.json\n- Displays task statuses with icons\n- Handles various error scenarios\n- Refreshes task status periodically\n\n## Milestone 3: Configuration and Flexibility\n### Objectives\n- Add configuration via environment variables\n- Support custom project directories\n- Implement command-line options\n- Create user documentation\n\n### Deliverables\n- Environment variable support\n- Command-line interface improvements\n- Detailed monitoring dashboard documentation\n- Example configuration scenarios\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- Configurable session names\n- Flexible log and project directory paths\n- Clear, comprehensive documentation\n- User-friendly CLI with help options\n\n## Milestone 4: Testing and Refinement\n### Objectives\n- Develop comprehensive test suite\n- Perform cross-platform testing\n- Optimize performance\n- Final refinements\n\n### Deliverables\n- Unit tests for task_watcher.py\n- Integration test scripts\n- Performance optimizations\n- Final documentation updates\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- 90%+ test coverage\n- Works on macOS and Linux\n- No performance bottlenecks\n- Clean, maintainable code\n\n## Milestone Dependencies\n- Milestone 2 depends on Milestone 1 completion\n- Milestone 3 depends on Milestone 2 completion\n- Milestone 4 can partially overlap with Milestone 3\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n- Use bash/python for maximum compatibility\n- Minimal external dependencies\n- Modular design for easy testing and modification'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Kzhx7qYdKo4nknfnWorGMK', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_224243.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260116_224243.md", "was_overwrite": true}