hould be consistent and memorable\\n   - Supports tracking of collective achievements\\n\\n2. **Family Name Inheritance**\\n   - All child agents automatically inherit the parent\'s family name\\n   - Family name persists throughout the entire task lifecycle\\n   - Stored in agent metadata and runtime state\\n\\n3. **UI and Tracking Enhancements**\\n   - Update UI hierarchy view to display family groupings\\n   - Expose family information through API endpoints\\n   - Create visual indicators for family-based relationships\\n\\n4. **Family Achievements**\\n   - Implement at least 3 types of family-level achievements\\n   - Track collective metrics across family members\\n   - Provide aggregated performance insights\\n\\n## Technical Implementation Locations\\n- Runtime System:\\n  * `src/runtime/agents/name_generator.py`\\n  * `src/runtime/agents/activity_tracker.py`\\n  * `src/runtime/agents/runtime.py`\\n\\n- Frontend Components:\\n  * Require updates to agent display interfaces\\n  * API endpoint modifications for family data exposure\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n- \\u2713 New tasks spawn with unique, consistent family names\\n- \\u2713 Child agents automatically inherit family name\\n- \\u2713 Family names visible in all agent displays\\n- \\u2713 API supports family information retrieval\\n- \\u2713 Family-level achievement tracking implemented\\n\\n## Constraints\\n- Maintain existing agent spawning mechanisms\\n- Minimal performance overhead for name generation\\n- Backwards compatibility with existing systems\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Detailed family history tracking\\n- Complex genealogy systems\\n- Permanent family assignments across multiple projects\\n\\n## Potential Family Achievement Types\\n1. Collective Task Completion\\n2. Efficiency Metrics\\n3. Innovation Score\\n4. Collaborative Problem Solving\\n\\n## Notes\\n- Use whimsical, memorable naming strategies\\n- Ensure randomness prevents predictable family names\\n- Design for extensibility of family concept"}'}, {'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_014jABQ3og9pD6uzexSUYH3j', 'content': '{"success": true, "current_branch": "milestone_2_implementation", "changes": {"staged": [{"file": "rc/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md", "status": "M"}], "unstaged": [{"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m1.md", "status": "M"}], "untracked": []}, "has_changes": true, "clean": false, "ahead": 0, "behind": 0, "last_commit": {"hash": "00b0c1770cc3475eab6867e3734c046b2815b677", "message": "Complete Milestone 1: Agent Families Name Generation and Runtime Integration", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "19 seconds ago"}, "stash_count": 0}'}, {'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01AUQ8BcD9pQQzFpamMv41DP', 'content': '{"success": true, "exit_code": 0, "stdout": "total 1552\\ndrwxr-xr-x@   3 mattbillock  staff      96 Jan 16 00:50 __tests__\\ndrwxr-xr-x@   7 mattbillock  staff     224 Jan 16 00:52 .\\ndrwxr-xr-x@   9 mattbillock  staff     288 Jan 16 14:44 ..\\ndrwxr-xr-x@   3 mattbillock  staff      96 Jan 16 00:51 contexts\\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 873 mattbillock  staff   27936 Jan 16 00:52 node_modules\\n-rw-r--r--@   1 mattbillock  staff  788216 Jan 16 00:52 package-lock.json\\n-rw-r--r--@   1 mattbillock  staff     498 Jan 16 00:51 package.json\\n", "stderr": ""}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-opus-4-5-20251101', 'system': 'You are a  agent.\n\n## Purpose\n\n\n## Instructions\n\n\n## Input Format\nYour input will be provided in the following format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## Output Format\nYou must respond with JSON matching this exact format:\n```json\n{}\n```\n\n## When to Request Clarification\nRequest clarification when:\n\n\n## Termination Conditions\nYou are done when:\n\n\nCRITICAL: Your response must be valid JSON matching the Output Format exactly.\n\n## Your Performance History\n- Success rate: 100.0%\n- Average iterations per task: 5.6\n\n**Tips for this run:**\n- Great work! Maintain your high performance standards.\n', 'tools': [{'name': 'write_file