chmarking, model migration, and validation. System Architect designed lightweight validation framework with Python-based metrics collection. Backend and Test Coordinators provided detailed task breakdowns for Milestone 1. TDD Coordinator initiated performance benchmarking planning. Project ready for implementation phase.",\n  "self_analysis": "I successfully executed the complete planning workflow for this model validation project. I efficiently coordinated with System Architect for architecture design, spawned Backend and Test Coordinators for comprehensive task breakdowns, and initiated TDD Coordinator for implementation planning. The sequential milestone approach provides clear progression from baseline establishment through model migration to performance validation.",\n  "performance_analysis": "System Architect delivered excellent focused architecture for model validation with minimal system disruption. Backend Coordinator identified 9 well-structured tasks with clear dependencies for metrics collection and validation framework. Test Coordinator provided comprehensive 26-test strategy across unit, integration, E2E, and performance testing. TDD Coordinator began performance benchmarking planning, though implementation details need further development in subsequent phases."\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Good progress! You reported status='success' and phase='milestones'. Please continue with the next step. Use the appropriate tools to proceed with implementation. Do not stop until all milestones are complete and status='success' with phase='complete'."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01M8oTuJTYakXB8bpsySkYYr', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/tdd_coordinator', 'input_data': {'problem_description': 'Complete Milestone 1: Performance Benchmarking - Implement the validation framework to benchmark the current claude-3-5-haiku-20241022 model performance. Based on the architecture and task breakd