{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 22:47:14", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-a1832c64-c925-4630-b364-c48684283b38', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "Implement the requirements documented in: src/field/ensemble_ui/output/executive_director_project_awareness/milestone1_backend_tasks.md\\n\\nRead the requirements document and implement all specified features.\\nFollow TDD methodology: write tests first, then implementation.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_013jqFEabANby9o4QWXJe36W', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Executive Director Project Awareness - Milestone 1 Backend', 'description': 'Implement backend tasks for executive director project awareness system as documented in milestone1_backend_tasks.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_013jqFEabANby9o4QWXJe36W', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "5f5539f5", "message": "Created project: Executive Director Project Awareness - Milestone 1 Backend", "summary": {"project_id": "5f5539f5", "project_name": "Executive Director Project Awareness - Milestone 1 Backend", "description": "Implement backend tasks for executive director project awareness system as documented in milestone1_backend_tasks.md", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-16T22:47:11.568939", "updated_at": "2026-01-16T22:47:11.568939", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo"