ormance degradation in agent execution\\n- **Dependencies**: All previous tasks\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n\\n## Task 7: Documentation and Code Comments\\n- **Description**: Update documentation for new components and changes\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  - Document CostCalculator usage and pricing model\\n  - Comment complex logic in ActivityTracker\\n  - Update README/architecture docs\\n  - Include examples of new metric tracking\\n- **Dependencies**: All previous tasks\\n- **Complexity**: Simple"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01CQ8T1DSEGqQUp6Lu5qVRP1', 'name': 'git_status', 'input': {'include_history': True, 'history_count': 5}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01CQ8T1DSEGqQUp6Lu5qVRP1', 'content': '{"success": true, "current_branch": "feature/tdd-model-validation-m1", "changes": {"staged": [{"file": "rc/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md", "status": "M"}], "unstaged": [{"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md", "status": "M"}], "untracked": ["src/field/ensemble_ui/output/github-bots/backend_tasks_m1.md"]}, "has_changes": true, "clean": false, "ahead": 0, "behind": 0, "last_commit": {"hash": "c20a28f1444a8ed22413bc6c9474cd1cdd9d6afa", "message": "Implement Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement - Backend Infrastructure (Milestone 1)", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "33 seconds ago"}, "history": [{"hash": "c20a28f1444a8ed22413bc6c9474cd1cdd9d6afa", "message": "Implement Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement - Backend Infrastructure (Milestone 1)", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "33 seconds ago"}, {"hash": "0d772f800b648f5c2cf2fec2803193a3b730b023", "message": "Complete milestone 1: Agent Cost Tracking Enhancement - backend infrastructure implementation finished", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "55 seconds ago"}, {"hash": "49958f620e0031819a42deeb66f74453d3342f9c", "message": "